{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, then grab it, move to destination, check object properties, and perform specific task. Otherwise, find alternative route or move to random location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = FindAlternativeRoute    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsPathBlocked    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
